WEBVTT

00:03.200 --> 00:06.900
Open the extension. Click the extension icon in the browser toolbar

00:07.000 --> 00:12.930
Transparent Floating Chat. Switch it on: chat appears over the video and the native chat collapses

00:13.030 --> 00:16.360
Drag the chat. Hover the box to show its drag bar, then drop it where you want

00:16.470 --> 00:19.669
Resize. Drag the bottom-right corner to make the box any size

00:19.770 --> 00:25.070
Minimize and reopen. The “—” button shrinks the box to a small badge; click the badge to reopen

00:25.170 --> 00:28.200
Show the border and header. Turn off “Hide Header & Border”: the box keeps a border and a fixed header

00:28.300 --> 00:31.430
Chat window background opacity. Drag the slider: the chat background gets darker

00:31.540 --> 00:34.470
Chat text font size. Text grows as you drag

00:34.570 --> 00:40.870
Username color. Adjust R, G, B or type a HEX code: names in chat change color at once

00:40.970 --> 00:51.370
Turn Danmaku on. Switch it on: each new comment scrolls across the video

00:51.470 --> 00:53.699
Danmaku running. New chat comments appear as scrolling lines with the sender's avatar

00:53.800 --> 00:59.499
Comment scroll speed. Drag to 4 seconds: comments cross faster

00:59.600 --> 01:06.230
Danmaku text color. Pick a separate color for scrolling text

01:06.340 --> 01:13.770
On-screen display area. Choose top 1/3, half, 3/4 or the full screen: here, the full screen

01:13.870 --> 01:17.070
Pause the video. Pause playback: the scrolling comments stop where they are

01:17.170 --> 01:24.270
Resume. Comments continue from where they stopped and new ones scroll across in turn

01:24.370 --> 01:30.300
Super Chat and memberships. A Super Chat scrolls with its amount and stands out in the chat box

01:30.410 --> 01:37.410
Fullscreen. Read chat while watching fullscreen, with no chat column beside the video

01:37.510 --> 01:42.640
English and Vietnamese. The VN / EN button at the top of the panel switches the language of the whole interface

01:42.740 --> 01:48.370
Turn the floating chat off. Switch it off: the floating box goes away and YouTube's native chat is restored
